<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Feb 04 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are:</p>
<p>copper up 8750, tin down 150, lead down 575, zinc down 2275, aluminium down 7500, nickel up 114, aluminium alloy up 260</p>
</text>
